  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "About this space<br><br>Welcome to 'Porkchop's Place' in the brand new luxury community of Twin Palms! Walking distance to shops and restaurants of 30A Avenue, 30A, and more!<br><br>GULF VIEWS from the rooftop terrace with PRIVATE HOT TUB, dining table, outdoor furniture with TV, and more!<br><br>6-Seater LSV/golf cart, 4 beach cruiser bikes included complimentary! Plus an EV charger! Gorgeous community pool access included<br><br>BRAND NEW beach home with tons of space to spread out or come together! A vacation dream!<br><br>The space<br><br>HOME HIGHLIGHTS:<br>-6-Seater LSV/golf cart included (these rent for $150/day)<br>-4 beach cruiser bikes provided complimentary<br>-Rooftop terrace with outdoor furniture, dining table, TV, living space, corn hole, FULL kitchen, and HOT TUB with GULF VIEWS!!<br>-Multiple balconies<br>-Community pool great for after the beach!<br>-Brand new, open concept floor plan with designer furnishing and top-of-the-line finishes (quartz counters, stainless steel appliances, etc!)<br>-5 Bedrooms + 4 full bathrooms + 1 half bathroom<br>-Gas fireplace<br>-Office nook<br>-Free WiFi<br>-TVs in all bedrooms and living areas<br><br>SLEEPING ARRANGEMENTS: Sleeps 16!<br><br>First Floor:<br>-Guest Bedroom 1: Queen bed, en-suite bathroom with glass shower (Sleeps 2)<br>-Second Living Area: Full size sleeper sofa, TV and sitting area (Sleeps 2)<br><br>Second Floor:<br>-Living room (queen air mattress if needed) with fireplace and smart TV (Sleeps 2)<br>-Kitchen<br>-Dining room<br>-Half bathroom<br><br>Third Floor:<br>-Master Bedroom 2: King bed, en-suite bathroom with glass shower (Sleeps 2)<br>-Guest Bedroom 3: Queen bed, shared bathroom with shower/tub combination, balcony access (Sleeps 2)<br>-Guest Bedroom 4: Queen bed, shared bathroom with shower/tub combination (Sleeps 2)<br>-Bunk Bedroom 5: One set of Twin-over-Full bunk beds and a Twin XL trundle bed, with en-suite bathroom with glass shower (Sleeps 4)<br>-Laundry room<br><br>Fourth Floor:<br>-Outdoor rooftop terrace <br>-Outdoor kitchen with built-in grill<br>-Hot tub, dining area, lounge chairs, corn hole, and Gulf views!<br><br>There is a pack n' play and air mattress available upon request.<br><br>Guest Access <br><br>Spot for one car in the garage and two cars in the driveway in addition to the LSV/golf cart. EV Charger available in the garage for electric car charging on the go!<br><br>Located less than a half-mile from the property, the new Highway 98 Underpass makes it easy to bike directly to Highway 30A without having to cross busy roads! This art-filled pathway, featuring vibrant murals and sculptures, is both a safe and scenic way for guests looking to explore the area!<br><br>Other things to note<br>-Pet friendly upon approval. Please inquire for non-refundable pet fee based on breed and size. <br>-Smoking is strictly prohibited.<br>-All renters must be over 25 years of age, or if under age 25 must be accompanied by a parent/legal guardian.<br>-LSV/golf cart is not to be driven past the town of Seagrove to the East, or to the West, or on Highway 98. Resolving any issue from the LSV/golf cart battery dying because of the renters not charging it will be charged to the renters.<br>-We provide a starter set of supplies such as toilet paper, paper towels, trash bags, dishwasher + laundry pods for your stay.<br>-Damage that occurs will be collected from the renters. <br>-Southern Holiday Homes can not be held liable for any damage or injury to any persons caused by LSV/golf cart, bikes, hot tub, or other amenities provided to guests.",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
          "title": "Brand New! Walk to 30A with Rooftop Hot Tub, Gulf Views, LSV/Golf Cart & Bikes! Pet Friendly!"
        }
      ],
